  <aside class="visitor-notice"><h2>Check again before you go</h2><p>Hours and reservations are planning facts, not a live opening confirmation. Check ${x("https://dlnr.hawaii.gov/dsp/important-park-notices/","State Parks notices")}, the ${x("https://www.weather.gov/hfo/","National Weather Service Honolulu forecast")} and the manager’s page for your destination.</p><p><strong>Temporary notices reviewed ${gt(O)}:</strong> State Parks lists storm-recovery closures and facility impacts around Hawaiʻi, including an ʻAiea Loop restroom closure through November 25. Makapuʻu Lookout repair work is separate from the Lighthouse Trail. Recheck the official notice because listed end dates are not reopening guarantees.</p></aside>
